  "_comment": [
    "Where each Objectives square sends you, keyed by the square's name EXACTLY as written in",
    "incursionSquares.json - %variables% still in place, since that is the stable key. Kept beside",
    "the squareset rather than inside it so incursionSquares.json stays a verbatim copy of its",
    "author's file and a new version can be dropped in without these having to be re-applied.",
    "",
    "Combined '(C)' squares are deliberately absent: they carry two objectives that usually pull you",
    "to two different places, so they are coloured from the combinedSquare category instead and an",
    "entry here would be ignored. See buildBingoBoard.",
    "",
    "'general' is a real answer, not a gap - 'Complete 4 Caves' or 'Kill 5 NPC Invaders' genuinely",
    "aren't anywhere in particular. A square with no entry at all falls back to it."
  ],

